https://www.instagram.com/devaether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Instagram\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@devaether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"TikTok\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/TheAether/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://aether.wiki.gg/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=data:image/png;base64,&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"wiki.gg\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2><center>💡 關於本擴充功能 💡</center></h2>\n\nEmissivity 擴充功能會將**發光材質套用至天境模組中的各種物品、方塊與裝備**。這代表當這些物件存在於世界中時，無論光照程度如何，其材質都會顯得明亮。\n\n這些變更適用於由**天境玉、鳳凰裝備、地牢符文石碑，甚至是排斥盾牌**所製成的物品。所有物品與方塊的發光材質皆透過模組的資料包檔案處理，而發光裝備則可在模組的設定選項中進行開關切換。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/emissivity0.png\"></center>\n<br>\n\n<h2><center>☁️ 更多來自天境團隊的內容 ☁️</center></h2>\n\n如果您對擴充功能有任何疑問，或單純對天境團隊開發的其他專案感興趣，歡迎加入天境計畫 Discord 伺服器！我們友善的團隊與熱情的社群，將確保您在此感受到如家般的溫暖！\n\n<center><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></center>\n<br>\n\n您也可以透過 Patreon 贊助來支持天境團隊！每一筆贊助都將直接投入開發工作，讓我們能繼續從事我們最熱愛的事。\n\n<center><a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></center>\n<br>",
